EXCLUSIVE : Sixty-years in the making, post-production is nearing completion on feature thriller The Wrong People , an adaptation of the 1967 novel of the same name by Robin Maugham, a dark thriller exposing trafficking in North Africa in the sixties.

First announced as a feature film in 1972, the project was shot in-and-around London and Essaouira, Morocco, in early 2026, with cast including Luke Newberry ( Anna Karenina ), Caroline Goodall ( Schindler's List ), Alec Newman ( The Weight ), Calum Ross ( Wednesday ), Branka Katic ( The King's Man ) and Joe Anderson ( Across the Universe ). Related Stories News ITV Issues Statement Amid Outcry Over AJ Odudu Experiencing "Microaggressions" On 'I'm A Celebrity... Get Me Out Of Here!' News Allison Janae Hamilton Launches Production Outfit Swampwife Pictures & Sets 'Holler' Starring Valerie June As First Project

Steven Fierberg, the veteran cinematographer of movies including Secretary and Love & Other Drugs and hit series including The Affair and Emily In Paris , has directed the film from a script written by David Griffin. Pic is being produced by Stephen Israel ( Swimming with Sharks ) via his production company School Pictures, alongside Ioanna Karavela ( Bad Day at the Office ). Executive producers are Brett Husbands and Tom Abell of LGBTQ specialist Peccadillo, which is handling UK & Irish distribution rights. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article1-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid","mid-articleX","mid-article","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[2,2],[300,250],[620,350],[300,251],[501,282],[3,3],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Watch on Deadline if ( !window.pmc.harmony?.isEventAdScheduledTime() ) { pmcCnx.cmd.push(function() { pmcCnx({ settings: { plugins: { pmcAtlasMG: { iabPlcmt: 2, } } }, playerId: '32fe25c4-79aa-406a-af44-69b41e969e71', playlistId: '0199e506-e642-7728-8264-463efe71337b', }).render("connatix_contextual_player_div"); }); } else { // This should only be get called when page cache is not cleared and it's event time. window.pmc.harmony?.switchToHarmonyPlayer(); }

The Wrong People "follows Arnold Turner (Newberry), a gay boarding-school teacher in England who travels to Tangier in search of respite from repression in the UK, where homosexuality remains illegal. There he befriends expat Lavinia Morris (Goodall) and falls in with the wealthy Clarence Baird (Newman), only to find himself blackmailed in the city&#x2019;s darker corners into trafficking one of his students, Dan (Ross), to Morocco, a plan that has devastating consequences."

Maugham&#x2019;s first explicitly gay-themed novel garnered controversy at the time of its publication given that homosexuality was still illegal in Britain for most of the 1960s.

Originally published under a pseudonym after Somerset Maugham advised his nephew Robin Maugham &#x201C;they will kill you&#x201D;, the well-received novel was championed by Oscar nominee Sal Mineo ( Rebel Without a Cause ), who spent many years trying to get the project financed before his untimely death in 1976. More recently, we wrote about the project six years ago as having a script by veteran UK screenwriter David McGillivray. The producers of this version of the movie acquired the rights from McGillivray. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dl-mid-article-inject2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article2","mid-articleX","mid-article","mid","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[300,250],[300,251],[620,350],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

War veteran and politician Maugham (the nephew of popular British playwright and novelist Somerset Maugham) is probably best known in film and literary circles for his novella The Servant which was the basis for the 1963 Jospeh Losey film of the same name with Dirk Bogarde, James Fox and Sarah Miles. He died in 1981.

&#x201C;The team has worked for many years to make this project a reality,&#x201D; said Israel who added, &#x201C;we are excited to have finally achieved what Sal had hoped for. We dedicate this film to him."

&#x201C;Steven and I have long wanted to work together,&#x201D; he noted. &#x201C;I&#x2019;m grateful we get to work on such an important addition to the canon of queer cinema.&#x201D;

&#x201C;I feel incredibly fortunate to have Alec Newman, Luke Newberry, Caroline Goodall and the wonderfully gifted Calum Ross joining us,&#x201D; said Fierberg. &#x201C;It&#x2019;s truly a dream cast. The story examines the depravity of human nature which some will exploit, and the corrosive effects of criminalizing sexual orientation.&#x201D;

Cinematographer is Alexandre Jamin (La Plain Verte ), casting director Anna Kennedy ( Nuremberg ), production designer Sabrina Linder ( I Swear ) and costume designer Lily Faith Knight ( The Gatehouse ).

Abell added: &#x201C;Robin Maugham used his place in the House of Lords to expose human trafficking when few wanted to listen, and Sal Mineo set out to film this story decades ago. We at Peccadillo admire the filmmakers&#x2019; bravery in at last bringing it to the screen, and are delighted to be distributing The Wrong People .&#x201D;

Luke Newberry is represented by Accelerate. Calum Ross is repped by The Artists Partnership. Caroline Goodall is represented by United Agents. Branka Katic is with Conway van Gelder Grant Joe Anderson is represented by United Agents. The Maugham estate is represented by Alan Brodie Representation Ltd.

The UK&#x2019;s leading film organization, the British Film Institute, is honouring actor Samantha Morton with its highest accolade: a BFI Fellowship .

The BFI said the honor recognizes Morton&#x2019;s &#x201C;extraordinary talent for bringing empathetic, raw and complex performances to her work.&#x201D;

The BFI Fellowship will be presented to Morton at the BFI Chair&#x2019;s Dinner on January 28. Later in 2027, BFI Southbank will host a retrospective of her decades-long career. The season will take place throughout June and include an in-conversation session with Morton. Related Stories News Samantha Morton On Why She "Hasn't Worked For A Year" Since 'The Odyssey' & Why She Was "Sad" & "Hurt" After Getting "Fired" From 'Her' News 'The Odyssey': What Do The Fates Have In Store For Christopher Nolan's Homeric Epic As Awards Season Gets Under Way?

Morton will be remembered most recently for her witchy turn in Chris Nolan&#x2019;s The Odyssey . Some of her other credits include Sweet and Lowdown, Minority Report, The Walking Dead, She Said, Under the Skin, Mister Lonely , and The Serpent Queen . She has also directed one feature, 2009&#x2019;s The Unloved . blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article1-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid","mid-articleX","mid-article","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[2,2],[300,250],[620,350],[300,251],[501,282],[3,3],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Watch on Deadline if ( !window.pmc.harmony?.isEventAdScheduledTime() ) { pmcCnx.cmd.push(function() { pmcCnx({ settings: { plugins: { pmcAtlasMG: { iabPlcmt: 2, } } }, playerId: '32fe25c4-79aa-406a-af44-69b41e969e71', playlistId: '0199e506-e642-7728-8264-463efe71337b', }).render("connatix_contextual_player_div"); }); } else { // This should only be get called when page cache is not cleared and it's event time. window.pmc.harmony?.switchToHarmonyPlayer(); }

Morton described the BFI Fellowship as the &#x201C;greatest honour and gift I could imagine&#x201D; in a statement.

&#x201C;From my first serious film role in Carine Adler's Under the Skin to bringing Circe to life for Christopher Nolan in The Odyssey , a truly life-changing experience, the BFI has always been there, a guardian of my hopes as an artist,&#x201D; she said, adding: &#x201C;Film changes lives. It has mine."

BFI Chair Jay Hunt added: &#x201C;Samantha is an extraordinary creative force and one of the most fearless actors of her generation. From her roots in independent film to her scene-stealing appearance in one of the biggest films of the year, The Odyssey, Samantha has had a powerful impact on audiences around the world for over 30 years. Her commitment to supporting young people and facilitating their access to the arts makes this BFI Fellowship even more meaningful. She epitomises the very best of the screen sector.&#x201D;

Previous BFI Fellows include David Lean, Bette Davis, Akira Kurosawa, Ousmane Semb&#xE8;ne, Elizabeth Taylor, Michael Powell, Emeric Pressburger, Orson Welles, Thelma Schoonmaker, Derek Jarman, Vanessa Redgrave, Maggie Smith, Martin Scorsese, Judi Dench, Satyajit Ray, Yasujir&#x14D; Ozu and, most recently, Tilda Swinton, Barbara Broccoli, Michael G Wilson, Spike Lee, Christopher Nolan, Tom Cruise, Guillermo del Toro and Laura Mulvey.

Francis Bourgeois, James Engelsman, and Thomas Holland are revving their engines for a second lap.

Amazon Prime Video has renewed The Grand Tour 's reincarnation for a second season, with Studio Lambert set to begin production next year.

Bourgeois, Engelsman, and Holland followed in the footsteps of Jeremy Clarkson, James May, and Richard Hammond, who hosted the motoring show between 2016 and 2024.

The trio said: &#x201C;Even with the blessings of Jeremy, James and Richard, taking on this job was probably more stupid than brave. But the reception to our first series was more positive than we could have ever imagined. And now, as we are continuing to find our feet in this world, we have the bravery to be even stupider, and the stupidity to be even braver.&#x201D; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article1-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid","mid-articleX","mid-article","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[2,2],[300,250],[620,350],[300,251],[501,282],[3,3],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

